@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:automation] validated-rules-update
The scheduled rules workflow MUST finish its validation and build gates before
creating or updating an update PR. Its commits MUST be restricted to the vendored
database, license, and provenance manifest.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:automation] protected-auto-merge
Automatic rules updates MUST target main through a pull request, use credentials
that trigger normal CI, and request auto-merge for the returned PR head SHA.
The workflow MUST NOT bypass branch protection or push directly to main.
